{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "NinjaSoft POS · API pública",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "summary": "API REST para integrar tienda online, ERP y planillas con NinjaSoft POS (plan Enterprise).",
    "description": "Autenticación OAuth2 client_credentials: con el client_id y el secreto de una credencial (Configuración > Integraciones > API, sólo el dueño) se pide un token Bearer de 1 hora. El negocio sale siempre de la credencial: ningún parámetro lo elige. Errores con forma {error: {code, message, details?}}. Límite de pedidos por minuto por credencial (headers RateLimit-*, 429 con Retry-After). Escrituras en lote de hasta 500 ítems con Idempotency-Key opcional (24 h). Ver docs/api-publica.md."
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://pos.soft.ninja/api/v1",
      "description": "Producción"
    }
  ],
  "security": [
    {
      "oauth2": []
    }
  ],
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "auth"
    },
    {
      "name": "productos"
    },
    {
      "name": "precios"
    },
    {
      "name": "stock"
    },
    {
      "name": "ventas"
    },
    {
      "name": "clientes"
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/oauth/token": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "auth"
        ],
        "operationId": "issueToken",
        "summary": "Pedir un token (client_credentials)",
        "description": "Credenciales por header Basic (client_id:client_secret) o en el cuerpo. Sin scope, el token lleva todos los alcances de la credencial. Errores con el formato de OAuth 2.0 (RFC 6749 §5.2).",
        "security": [],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/x-www-form-urlencoded": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TokenRequest"
              }
            },
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TokenRequest"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Token emitido",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TokenResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/OAuthError"
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/OAuthError"
          },
          "403": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/OAuthError"
          },
          "429": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/OAuthError"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/products": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "productos"
        ],
        "operationId": "listProducts",
        "summary": "Listar productos (cursor por fecha de modificación)",
        "description": "Orden por updated_at e id. Para sincronizar cambios, guardá el next_cursor o usá updated_since. Un producto modificado mientras paginás vuelve a aparecer al final (nunca se pierde). Alcance products:read.",
        "security": [
          {
            "oauth2": [
              "products:read"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Limit500"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Cursor"
          },
          {
            "name": "updated_since",
            "in": "query",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "date-time"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "sku",
            "in": "query",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "maxLength": 64
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "include_deleted",
            "in": "query",
            "schema": {
              "type": "boolean",
              "default": false
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Página de productos",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "data",
                    "next_cursor"
                  ],
                  "properties": {
                    "data": {
                      "type": "array",
                      "items": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Product"
                      }
                    },
                    "next_cursor": {
                      "type": [
                        "string",
                        "null"
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "headers": {
              "RateLimit-Limit": {
                "$ref": "#/components/headers/RateLimit-Limit"
              },
              "RateLimit-Remaining": {
                "$ref": "#/components/headers/RateLimit-Remaining"
              },
              "RateLimit-Reset": {
                "$ref": "#/components/headers/RateLimit-Reset"
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          },
          "403": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          },
          "422": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          },
          "429": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/products/batch": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "productos"
        ],
        "operationId": "upsertProducts",
        "summary": "Crear o editar productos por SKU (hasta 500)",
        "description": "Un campo ausente no se toca (en un alta toma el valor por defecto). Resultado por ítem: created, updated, unchanged o error (barcode_in_use, name_required). El stock no se carga acá: usá /stock/adjustments. Alcance products:write.",
        "security": [
          {
            "oauth2": [
              "products:write"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/IdempotencyKey"
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "additionalProperties": false,
                "required": [
                  "items"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "items": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "minItems": 1,
                    "maxItems": 500,
                    "items": {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ProductInput"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/BatchResult"
          },
          "400": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          },
          "403": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          },
          "409": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          },
          "413": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          },
          "415": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          },
          "422": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          },
          "429": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/prices/batch": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "precios"
        ],
        "operationId": "updatePrices",
        "summary": "Cambiar precio (y costo) por SKU (hasta 500)",
        "description": "Queda en el historial de precios como importación. Resultado por ítem: updated, unchanged o error (product_not_found). Alcance prices:write.",
        "security": [
          {
            "oauth2": [
              "prices:write"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/IdempotencyKey"
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "additionalProperties": false,
                "required": [
                  "items"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "items": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "minItems": 1,
                    "maxItems": 500,
                    "items": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "additionalProperties": false,
                      "required": [
                        "sku",
                        "price"
                      ],
                      "properties": {
                        "sku": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "minLength": 1,
                          "maxLength": 64
                        },
                        "price": {
                          "type": "number",
                          "minimum": 0
                        },
                        "cost": {
                          "type": [
                            "number",
                            "null"
                          ],
                          "minimum": 0
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/BatchResult"
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          },
          "403": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          },
          "409": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          },
          "422": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          },
          "429": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/stores": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "stock"
        ],
        "operationId": "listStores",
        "summary": "Sucursales del negocio",
        "security": [
          {
            "oauth2": [
              "stock:read"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Sucursales",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "data": {
                      "type": "array",
                      "items": {
                        "type": "object",
                        "properties": {
                          "id": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "format": "uuid"
                          },
                          "name": {
                            "type": "string"
                          },
                          "is_default": {
                            "type": "boolean"
                          },
                          "is_active": {
                            "type": "boolean"
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          },
          "403": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          },
          "429": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/stock": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "stock"
        ],
        "operationId": "listStock",
        "summary": "Stock por sucursal",
        "description": "Productos sin variantes. Un producto sin fila en una sucursal tiene 0 ahí. Alcance stock:read.",
        "security": [
          {
            "oauth2": [
              "stock:read"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "store_id",
            "in": "query",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "uuid"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "sku",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "SKU separados por coma (hasta 500).",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Limit500"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Cursor"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Página de saldos",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "data": {
                      "type": "array",
                      "items": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/schemas/StockRow"
                      }
                    },
                    "next_cursor": {
                      "type": [
                        "string",
                        "null"
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          },
          "403": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          },
          "404": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          },
          "422": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          },
          "429": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/stock/adjustments": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "stock"
        ],
        "operationId": "adjustStock",
        "summary": "Ajustar o contar stock por sucursal con motivo (hasta 500)",
        "description": "mode delta suma o resta qty; mode set fija el saldo (conteo, motivo count). Sin store_id va a la sucursal principal; otra sucursal pide stock por sucursal en el plan. Cada ajuste deja su movimiento y queda auditado. Resultado por ítem: adjusted, unchanged o error (product_not_found, store_not_found, variants_not_supported, feature_not_in_plan). Alcance stock:write.",
        "security": [
          {
            "oauth2": [
              "stock:write"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/IdempotencyKey"
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "additionalProperties": false,
                "required": [
                  "items"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "items": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "minItems": 1,
                    "maxItems": 500,
                    "items": {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/StockAdjustment"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/BatchResult"
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          },
          "403": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          },
          "409": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          },
          "422": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          },
          "429": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/sales": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "ventas"
        ],
        "operationId": "listSales",
        "summary": "Ventas por rango (sólo lectura)",
        "description": "Rango [from, to) de hasta 93 días, orden por fecha de creación. Incluye ítems y cobros. Las anuladas vienen con status voided. Alcance sales:read.",
        "security": [
          {
            "oauth2": [
              "sales:read"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "from",
            "in": "query",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "date-time"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "to",
            "in": "query",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "date-time"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "store_id",
            "in": "query",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "uuid"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "limit",
            "in": "query",
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 1,
              "maximum": 200,
              "default": 50
            }
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Cursor"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Página de ventas",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "data": {
                      "type": "array",
                      "items": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Sale"
                      }
                    },
                    "next_cursor": {
                      "type": [
                        "string",
                        "null"
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          },
          "403": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          },
          "404": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          },
          "422": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          },
          "429": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/customers": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "clientes"
        ],
        "operationId": "listCustomers",
        "summary": "Listar clientes (cursor por fecha de modificación)",
        "security": [
          {
            "oauth2": [
              "customers:read"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Limit500"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Cursor"
          },
          {
            "name": "updated_since",
            "in": "query",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "date-time"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "external_id",
            "in": "query",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "maxLength": 100
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "include_deleted",
            "in": "query",
            "schema": {
              "type": "boolean",
              "default": false
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Página de clientes",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "data": {
                      "type": "array",
                      "items": {
                        "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Customer"
                      }
                    },
                    "next_cursor": {
                      "type": [
                        "string",
                        "null"
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          },
          "403": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          },
          "429": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/customers/batch": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "clientes"
        ],
        "operationId": "upsertCustomers",
        "summary": "Crear o editar clientes por id o external_id (hasta 500)",
        "description": "Cada ítem trae id (cliente existente) o external_id (clave del sistema externo, única por negocio). No toca la cuenta corriente. Resultado por ítem: created, updated, unchanged o error (customer_not_found, external_id_in_use, name_required). Alcance customers:write.",
        "security": [
          {
            "oauth2": [
              "customers:write"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/IdempotencyKey"
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "additionalProperties": false,
                "required": [
                  "items"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "items": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "minItems": 1,
                    "maxItems": 500,
                    "items": {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CustomerInput"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/BatchResult"
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          },
          "403": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          },
          "409": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          },
          "422": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          },
          "429": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "securitySchemes": {
      "oauth2": {
        "type": "oauth2",
        "flows": {
          "clientCredentials": {
            "tokenUrl": "/api/v1/oauth/token",
            "scopes": {
              "products:read": "Leer productos",
              "products:write": "Crear y editar productos",
              "stock:read": "Leer sucursales y stock",
              "stock:write": "Ajustar stock",
              "prices:write": "Cambiar precios",
              "sales:read": "Leer ventas",
              "customers:read": "Leer clientes",
              "customers:write": "Crear y editar clientes"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "parameters": {
      "Limit500": {
        "name": "limit",
        "in": "query",
        "schema": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 1,
          "maximum": 500,
          "default": 100
        }
      },
      "Cursor": {
        "name": "cursor",
        "in": "query",
        "description": "next_cursor de la página anterior (opaco).",
        "schema": {
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "IdempotencyKey": {
        "name": "Idempotency-Key",
        "in": "header",
        "description": "Clave única por pedido (8 a 128 caracteres: letras, números, . _ : -). Repetirla con el mismo cuerpo devuelve la misma respuesta (header Idempotent-Replayed: true) sin volver a aplicar; con otro cuerpo, 409.",
        "schema": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9._:-]{8,128}$"
        }
      }
    },
    "responses": {
      "Error": {
        "description": "Error",
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "OAuthError": {
        "description": "Error de OAuth 2.0",
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": {
              "type": "object",
              "required": [
                "error"
              ],
              "properties": {
                "error": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "examples": [
                    "invalid_client",
                    "invalid_scope",
                    "unsupported_grant_type",
                    "feature_not_in_plan",
                    "rate_limited"
                  ]
                },
                "error_description": {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "BatchResult": {
        "description": "Resultado por ítem",
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": {
              "type": "object",
              "required": [
                "summary",
                "results"
              ],
              "properties": {
                "summary": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "additionalProperties": {
                    "type": "integer"
                  }
                },
                "results": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "required": [
                      "index",
                      "status"
                    ],
                    "properties": {
                      "index": {
                        "type": "integer"
                      },
                      "sku": {
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "external_id": {
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "id": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "format": "uuid"
                      },
                      "status": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "enum": [
                          "created",
                          "updated",
                          "unchanged",
                          "adjusted",
                          "error"
                        ]
                      },
                      "error": {
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "qty": {
                        "type": "number"
                      },
                      "delta": {
                        "type": "number"
                      },
                      "store_id": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "format": "uuid"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "schemas": {
      "Error": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "error"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "error": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "code",
              "message"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "code": {
                "type": "string",
                "examples": [
                  "invalid_token",
